  "testedRevisionNote": "A workflow_dispatch takes a branch, and hands-finish was at d9d5afaf for both dispatches. git diff ef9f809d d9d5afaf -- . ':!docs' is empty: the HF-6, HF-7 and HF-8 commits after the fix are docs only, so the native sources, native tests and workflows the runs built are those of ef9f809d. Review round two's uncommitted worktree changes (two test files and docs) are not in these runs; neither test file is built or run by windows-build or windows-arm64-test.",
