  "rootCause": "HF-5 (hands-progress.md HF-5 section, deviation HF-5 point 1): apps-running-target failed at apps-list-reply / paused when a Dispatcher pause cancellation, most likely the first native-detection loss of the uncalibrated scope, cancelled row 1's in-flight apps.list. Physical takeover is excluded by the HF-4 rows, which strongly supports but does not prove it. The hosted-runner trigger of the detection loss is not identified.",
  "fix": "ef9f809d: NativeScenario::settle_input_detection forces the uncalibrated scope's only possible verdict through UserInputService::setup_reset after row 0 is marked passed and before run(1), and waits at most 1,000 ms (10 ms poll) for the pause; a missing pause fails row 0 with deadline_exceeded at input-settle-context, input-settle-session or input-settle-verdict. Only the isolated self-test's row ordering changed; the Dispatcher, WindowService and UserInputService are unchanged.",
